WEBVTT

00:04:29.667 --> 00:04:31.870
to get answers.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.176
Now, don't get me wrong,

00:04:34.176 --> 00:04:37.381
dictionaries are fantastic resources,

00:04:37.381 --> 00:04:38.930
but they are human

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:41.211
and they are not timeless.

00:04:41.211 --> 00:04:43.013
I'm struck as a teacher

00:04:43.013 --> 00:04:46.230
that we tell students to critically question

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.964
every text they read, every website they visit,

00:04:49.964 --> 00:04:51.452
except dictionaries,

00:04:51.452 --> 00:04:54.617
which we tend to treat as un-authored,

00:04:54.617 --> 00:04:57.259
as if they came from nowhere to give us answers

00:04:57.259 --> 00:05:01.603
about what words really mean.